  - m_Id: 22118630501113856
    m_Localized: "Player: I used to live here many years ago. Decided to come back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118630505308160
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: bonjourrrrrrrrrrrrr"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118630505308161
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: okaaaaaa..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118630505308162
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118723589496832
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: It's great that our town has a driver again! There used to be lots of cars here, and now we've got a gas station but no cars... Ah..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118723589496833
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I can't even drive up to Grandma in the hills or over to the Baker's... But that's not what I meant to say!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22118723589496834
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: bonjourrrrrrrrrrrrr"
    m_Metadata:
