    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I've got it!!! Bring her this painting and ask if she'd mind meeting me by the Lake tomorrow..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121727445164032
    m_Localized: "Owl: Why, thank you! How is my grandson doing? Working hard? Dressing warmly? (laughs)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121727445164033
    m_Localized: "Owl: And when am I getting great-grandchildren? Oh, he'll leave his grandma without any! By any chance, do you know if he's found himself a bride yet? Maybe he likes someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121727445164034
    m_Localized: "Owl: Run along, dear."
