    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133443
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133444
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133445
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133446
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133447
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133448
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133449
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22121958979133450
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918336
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Sorry, I don't have any more jobs right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918337
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: You've really got a lovely little car!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918338
    m_Localized: "Player: Thanks. I brought you the tires from the school bus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918339
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Awesome! Just a little more and I'll be able to build my very own car! Then I'll get to see the Baker every day... Oops!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918340
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: If you happen to pass by, ask how the Baker is doing for me. Is everything all right with her?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918341
    m_Localized: "Player: Is she your friend?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918342
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: We barely know each other, to be honest... still, please ask..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918343
    m_Localized: "Player:  Может быть ей привезти что нибудь от тебя?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918344
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Exactly, let's do that, but what should I give her... hmm..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22122642331918345
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Go on, quick! I can't wait to hear how it goes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614784
    m_Localized: "Principal: Ah, it's you again. What do I owe the pleasure?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614785
    m_Localized: "Player: I wanted to talk about the Cat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614786
    m_Localized: "Principal: About your little companion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614787
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. I still want to enroll him in school, but I still haven't managed to gather the required amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614788
    m_Localized: "Principal: I understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614789
    m_Localized: "Player: But I was told that sometimes you do make exceptions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614790
    m_Localized: "Principal: Hm. Curious who told you that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614791
    m_Localized: "Player: That's not the important part. What matters is that the Cat needs a home, and the Elk needs a friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614792
    m_Localized: "Principal: Is that so..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614793
    m_Localized: "Player: Your son really wants someone to study with. He wanted to ask you himself to take the Cat in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614794
    m_Localized: "Principal: He wanted to ask me himself?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614795
    m_Localized: "Principal: Ah, it's you again. What do I owe the pleasure?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614796
    m_Localized: "Player: I wanted to talk about the Cat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614797
    m_Localized: "Principal: About your little companion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614798
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. I still want to enroll him in school, but I still haven't managed to gather the required amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614799
    m_Localized: "Principal: I understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614800
    m_Localized: "Player: But I was told that sometimes you do make exceptions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614801
    m_Localized: "Principal: Hm. Curious who told you that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614802
    m_Localized: "Player: That's not the important part. What matters is that the Cat needs a home, and the Elk needs a friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614803
    m_Localized: "Principal: The Cat can stay. There will always be a place for him at the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614804
    m_Localized: "Player:  Вот Вы где!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614805
    m_Localized: "Owl: A sound mind in a sound body! At my age, that becomes obvious. And you, young man, must be that new delivery driver I've heard so much about. Very pleased!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614806
    m_Localized: "Player: Likewise. The Principal asked me to deliver a package. Here you go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614807
    m_Localized: "Owl: Why, thank you! How is my grandson doing? Working hard? Dressing warmly? (laughs)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614808
    m_Localized: "Owl: And when am I getting great-grandchildren? Oh, he'll leave his grandma without any! By any chance, do you know if he's found himself a bride yet? Maybe he likes someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614809
    m_Localized: "Player:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614810
    m_Localized: "Owl: Run along, dear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614811
    m_Localized: "Owl: Hey, what's up?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614812
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614813
    m_Localized: "Owl: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614814
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614815
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614816
    m_Localized: "Baker: Hey, what's up?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614817
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614818
    m_Localized: "Baker: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614819
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614820
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614821
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614822
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614823
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614824
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614825
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614826
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22123512490614827
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222006804480
    m_Localized: "Player: I told her exactly that. She thanked you for the painting and agreed to meet you by the Lake."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496256
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Really!? Wow... Did she actually agree?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496257
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. Looks like she really liked the painting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496258
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Well... there's no turning back now!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496259
    m_Localized: "Player: Looks like it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496260
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: You know... we already met up. And I think it went even better than I dreamed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496261
    m_Localized: "Player: Is that so? Congratulations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496262
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Thanks. Who would've thought... I spent years trying to work up the courage, and in the end it was the new delivery driver who helped."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496263
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Now not only is my car almost assembled, but it feels like my whole life has finally started moving again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496264
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm happy for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496265
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I'm happy for myself too! All right, I won't keep you. I hope things work out for you and the Cat too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496266
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Thank you. Without you, I never would've dared to talk to the Baker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496267
    m_Localized: "Cat: Meow!?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496268
    m_Localized: "Player: Who are you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496269
    m_Localized: "Cat: I... I don't know..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496270
    m_Localized: "Player: Easy, easy. Just tell me where your home is, and I'll take you there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496271
    m_Localized: "Cat: I don't know where my home is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496272
    m_Localized: "Player: How long have you been here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496273
    m_Localized: "Cat: It's cold and I'm hungry here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496274
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, get in the car and we'll figure out what to do with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496275
    m_Localized: "Cat: I'm cold!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496276
    m_Localized: "Elk: Hello, mister... Who are you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496277
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm a delivery driver. I was asked to bring two cartons of milk from the farm for the baker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222086496278
    m_Localized: "Elk: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884864
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884865
    m_Localized: "Elk: Hey, what's up?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884866
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884867
    m_Localized: "Elk: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884868
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884869
    m_Localized: "Player: Hello, are you the Principal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884870
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Yes, and you, my good fellow, must be our new driver? Thank you for the equipment!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884871
    m_Localized: "Teacher: If there's anything I can do for you, just say the word!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884872
    m_Localized: "Player: I found a kitten who doesn't know where his home is. Do you know where I could place him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884873
    m_Localized: "Teacher: We have a boarding school for children. Unfortunately, tuition isn't free: the school has to pay for food, textbooks, and the teachers' work..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884874
    m_Localized: "Player: And how much does tuition cost?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884875
    m_Localized: "Teacher: 5000"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884876
    m_Localized: "Player: That much!? Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884877
    m_Localized: "Teacher: On this island, there are always people who need something delivered..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884878
    m_Localized: "Teacher: By the way, could you take these old books? They've been sitting uselessly in the library for years."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884879
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Could you deliver them to Grandma Owl? She absolutely loves detective stories."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884880
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Go on, I'll be waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884881
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884882
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884883
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is after my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884884
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884885
    m_Localized: "Principal: Is that so..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884886
    m_Localized: "Player: Your son really wants someone to study with. He wanted to ask you himself to take the Cat in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884887
    m_Localized: "Principal: He wanted to ask me himself?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884888
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. It matters to him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884889
    m_Localized: "Principal: You know... perhaps I really do spend too much time thinking about bills, firewood, textbooks, and forget who all this is for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884890
    m_Localized: "Principal: If my son wants the Cat to study with him, then so be it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884891
    m_Localized: "Player: Really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884892
    m_Localized: "Principal: Yes. I'm admitting the Cat to the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884893
    m_Localized: "Player: Thank you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884894
    m_Localized: "Principal: No need. Sometimes a school doesn't really need money - it just needs someone worth caring for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884895
    m_Localized: "Principal: Congratulations. It looks like this will be your Cat's new home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884896
    m_Localized: "Principal: The Cat can stay. There will always be a place for him at the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884897
    m_Localized: "Player:  Вот Вы где!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884898
    m_Localized: "Owl: A sound mind in a sound body! At my age, that becomes obvious. And you, young man, must be that new delivery driver I've heard so much about. Very pleased!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884899
    m_Localized: "Player: Likewise. The Principal asked me to deliver a package. Here you go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884900
    m_Localized: "Owl: Why, thank you! How is my grandson doing? Working hard? Dressing warmly? (laughs)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884901
    m_Localized: "Owl: And when am I getting great-grandchildren? Oh, he'll leave his grandma without any! By any chance, do you know if he's found himself a bride yet? Maybe he likes someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884902
    m_Localized: "Player:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884903
    m_Localized: "Owl: Run along, dear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884904
    m_Localized: "Grandma: These buns smell wonderful! Thank you for getting here so quickly!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884905
    m_Localized: "Player: Always happy to help!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884906
    m_Localized: "Owl: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884907
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884908
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884909
    m_Localized: "Baker: Hey, what's up?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884910
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884911
    m_Localized: "Baker: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884912
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884913
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884914
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884915
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884916
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884917
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884918
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884919
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126222094884920
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536320
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I heard you stopped by the farm. How is the little Elk doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536321
    m_Localized: "Player: He's managing. But he said he's scared to go to school without friends."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536322
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Hmmm... What about your Cat? Isn't he going to school too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536323
    m_Localized: "Player: I'd gladly send him there, but I don't have that much money.."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536324
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I see... Back in my day, education was free! It's all gone..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536325
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Actually, the Principal isn't nearly as strict as he likes to seem. If his son asks him to take in the Cat, I'm sure he will!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536326
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Oh, I almost forgot, I promised to send the Elk some ice for the cellar. Just hurry before it all melts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536327
    m_Localized: "Grandma: If you hurry, the ice might still make it there in one piece."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536328
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536329
    m_Localized: "Baker: Oh, you're here so early, I'm afraid I don't have anything to offer you yet! Unless you'd like some cocoa?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536330
    m_Localized: "Player: No, thank you. Grandma asked me to bring her six buns..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536331
    m_Localized: "Baker: Shlepa"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536332
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536333
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536334
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536335
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536336
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536337
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536338
    m_Localized: "Player: That was seriously cringe."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536339
    m_Localized: "Baker: This is after my second dialogue."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126370212536340
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019200
    m_Localized: "Baker: What bad timing! We've just run out of milk. This morning it all went into the cherry pie... I can't bake your buns without it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019201
    m_Localized: "Player: I can bring some. Just tell me where I need to go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019202
    m_Localized: "Baker: Usually the Elk brings it from his farm, but he didn't show up today for some reason. Ask him to find us two cartons of milk. Just be careful, he's a little scared of strangers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019203
    m_Localized: "Baker: Without milk, I can't bake buns no matter how hard I try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019204
    m_Localized: "Baker: You brought it? Oh, thank you so much! I'll put the buns in the oven right away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019205
    m_Localized: "Baker: But it'll take a little time. Could you take this cherry pie to the school in the meantime? You have to drive quickly, though, or it'll cool off and won't be nearly as magical!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019206
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, should I pass anything else along?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019207
    m_Localized: "Baker: Yes, it's the Principal's birthday today, so don't forget to congratulate him! Maybe he'll be just a little kinder..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019208
    m_Localized: "Baker: Hurry, the pie is only good while it's warm!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019209
    m_Localized: "Player: I have a gift for you from the Gas Station Attendant - this beautiful painting! And an equally beautiful invitation to meet by the Lake tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019210
    m_Localized: "Baker: How lovely! Give him my heartfelt thanks and be sure to tell him I'll come tomorrow!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019211
    m_Localized: "Baker: I almost forgot - here are some cinnamon rolls for Grandma. Please take them to her quickly before they go bad!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019212
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, I'll be there in no time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126605492019213
    m_Localized: "Baker: Be sure to tell him I'll come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900544
    m_Localized: "Elk: Aaaah, I see. All right, I'll bring everything right away. You'll have to drive fast, though, because the weather's been really hot lately!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900545
    m_Localized: "Player: Thank you! You're so independent. But why are you here all alone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900546
    m_Localized: "Elk: Dad says the farm doesn't bring in much money, so he works at the school to earn extra. He says I need an education, so he wants to teach me himself..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900547
    m_Localized: "Player: I see. So your dad is the School Principal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900548
    m_Localized: "Elk: Yes, but honestly, I really don't want to go there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900549
    m_Localized: "Elk: I don't have any friends my age at all..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900550
    m_Localized: "Player: Don't be afraid. I hope the Cat will go to school with you. I'll make sure to introduce you two later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900551
    m_Localized: "Elk: All right! If you happen to see Dad, please ask him to come by. We've been having some power issues, and I got scared there might be a fire, so I didn't bring the milk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900552
    m_Localized: "Elk: Just make sure to drive the milk over quickly, or it'll spoil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900553
    m_Localized: "Elk: Oh, it's you again! Dad still hasn't stopped by..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900554
    m_Localized: "Player: I actually wanted to talk to you. I have an idea."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900555
    m_Localized: "Elk: What kind?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900556
    m_Localized: "Player: Remember the Cat I told you about? He's all alone too, and he's scared too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900557
    m_Localized: "Elk: Yeah... I feel bad for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900558
    m_Localized: "Player: If you ask your dad yourself to let the Cat into the school, I think he'll listen to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900559
    m_Localized: "Elk: Really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900560
    m_Localized: "Player: Of course. You're his son, and you know better than anyone what it's like to be alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900561
    m_Localized: "Elk: I've never asked Dad for anything like that before..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900562
    m_Localized: "Player: Then this will be the first time. Sometimes you just have to say the important things out loud."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900563
    m_Localized: "Elk: Do you think he won't be angry?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900564
    m_Localized: "Player: I think he'll see how important this is to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900565
    m_Localized: "Elk: Then... I'll try. I'll tell him the Cat needs to study with me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900566
    m_Localized: "Player: That's the spirit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900567
    m_Localized: "Elk: Thank you, mister. It wouldn't be so scary with the Cat around."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900568
    m_Localized: "Elk: I'll talk to Dad. I'm just really nervous..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900569
    m_Localized: "Player: Hello, are you the Principal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900570
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Yes, and you, my good fellow, must be our new driver? Thank you for the equipment!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900571
    m_Localized: "Teacher: If there's anything I can do for you, just say the word!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900572
    m_Localized: "Player: I found a kitten who doesn't know where his home is. Do you know where I could place him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900573
    m_Localized: "Teacher: We have a boarding school for children. Unfortunately, tuition isn't free: the school has to pay for food, textbooks, and the teachers' work..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900574
    m_Localized: "Player: And how much does tuition cost?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900575
    m_Localized: "Teacher: 5000"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900576
    m_Localized: "Player: That much!? Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900577
    m_Localized: "Teacher: On this island, there are always people who need something delivered..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900578
    m_Localized: "Teacher: By the way, could you take these old books? They've been sitting uselessly in the library for years."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900579
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Could you deliver them to Grandma Owl? She absolutely loves detective stories."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900580
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Go on, I'll be waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900581
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900582
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900583
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is after my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900584
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900585
    m_Localized: "Principal: Ah, it's you again. What do I owe the pleasure?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900586
    m_Localized: "Player: I wanted to talk about the Cat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900587
    m_Localized: "Principal: About your little companion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900588
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. I still want to enroll him in school, but I still haven't managed to gather the required amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900589
    m_Localized: "Principal: I understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900590
    m_Localized: "Player: But I was told that sometimes you do make exceptions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900591
    m_Localized: "Principal: Hm. Curious who told you that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900592
    m_Localized: "Player: That's not the important part. What matters is that the Cat needs a home, and the Elk needs a friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900593
    m_Localized: "Principal: Is that so..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900594
    m_Localized: "Player: Your son really wants someone to study with. He wanted to ask you himself to take the Cat in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900595
    m_Localized: "Principal: He wanted to ask me himself?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900596
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. It matters to him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900597
    m_Localized: "Principal: You know... perhaps I really do spend too much time thinking about bills, firewood, textbooks, and forget who all this is for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900598
    m_Localized: "Principal: If my son wants the Cat to study with him, then so be it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900599
    m_Localized: "Player: Really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900600
    m_Localized: "Principal: Yes. I'm admitting the Cat to the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900601
    m_Localized: "Player: Thank you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900602
    m_Localized: "Principal: No need. Sometimes a school doesn't really need money - it just needs someone worth caring for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900603
    m_Localized: "Principal: Congratulations. It looks like this will be your Cat's new home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900604
    m_Localized: "Principal: The Cat can stay. There will always be a place for him at the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900605
    m_Localized: "Player:  Вот Вы где!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900606
    m_Localized: "Owl: A sound mind in a sound body! At my age, that becomes obvious. And you, young man, must be that new delivery driver I've heard so much about. Very pleased!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900607
    m_Localized: "Player: Likewise. The Principal asked me to deliver a package. Here you go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900608
    m_Localized: "Owl: Why, thank you! How is my grandson doing? Working hard? Dressing warmly? (laughs)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900609
    m_Localized: "Owl: And when am I getting great-grandchildren? Oh, he'll leave his grandma without any! By any chance, do you know if he's found himself a bride yet? Maybe he likes someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900610
    m_Localized: "Player:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900611
    m_Localized: "Owl: Run along, dear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900612
    m_Localized: "Grandma: These buns smell wonderful! Thank you for getting here so quickly!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900613
    m_Localized: "Player: Always happy to help!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900614
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I heard you stopped by the farm. How is the little Elk doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900615
    m_Localized: "Player: He's managing. But he said he's scared to go to school without friends."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900616
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Hmmm... What about your Cat? Isn't he going to school too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900617
    m_Localized: "Player: I'd gladly send him there, but I don't have that much money.."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900618
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I see... Back in my day, education was free! It's all gone..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900619
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Actually, the Principal isn't nearly as strict as he likes to seem. If his son asks him to take in the Cat, I'm sure he will!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900620
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Oh, I almost forgot, I promised to send the Elk some ice for the cellar. Just hurry before it all melts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900621
    m_Localized: "Grandma: If you hurry, the ice might still make it there in one piece."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900622
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900623
    m_Localized: "Baker: Oh, you're here so early, I'm afraid I don't have anything to offer you yet! Unless you'd like some cocoa?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900624
    m_Localized: "Player: No, thank you. Grandma asked me to bring her six buns..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900625
    m_Localized: "Baker: What bad timing! We've just run out of milk. This morning it all went into the cherry pie... I can't bake your buns without it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900626
    m_Localized: "Player: I can bring some. Just tell me where I need to go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900627
    m_Localized: "Baker: Usually the Elk brings it from his farm, but he didn't show up today for some reason. Ask him to find us two cartons of milk. Just be careful, he's a little scared of strangers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900628
    m_Localized: "Baker: Without milk, I can't bake buns no matter how hard I try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900629
    m_Localized: "Baker: You brought it? Oh, thank you so much! I'll put the buns in the oven right away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900630
    m_Localized: "Baker: But it'll take a little time. Could you take this cherry pie to the school in the meantime? You have to drive quickly, though, or it'll cool off and won't be nearly as magical!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900631
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, should I pass anything else along?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900632
    m_Localized: "Baker: Yes, it's the Principal's birthday today, so don't forget to congratulate him! Maybe he'll be just a little kinder..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900633
    m_Localized: "Baker: Hurry, the pie is only good while it's warm!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900634
    m_Localized: "Player: I have a gift for you from the Gas Station Attendant - this beautiful painting! And an equally beautiful invitation to meet by the Lake tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900635
    m_Localized: "Baker: How lovely! Give him my heartfelt thanks and be sure to tell him I'll come tomorrow!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900636
    m_Localized: "Baker: I almost forgot - here are some cinnamon rolls for Grandma. Please take them to her quickly before they go bad!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900637
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, I'll be there in no time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22126874497900638
    m_Localized: "Baker: Be sure to tell him I'll come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518933716992
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant:  У нас на острове редко встретишь гостей. Какими судьбами?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077120
    m_Localized: "Player: I used to live here many years ago. Decided to come back."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077121
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: It's great that our town has a driver again! There used to be lots of cars here, and now we've got a gas station but no cars... Ah..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077122
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I can't even drive up to Grandma in the hills or over to the Baker's... But that's not what I meant to say!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077123
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Listen... this means you could really help us out! We got some parts for the school's radio tower, and they need to be delivered."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077124
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: We won't forget the favor, so today's gas is on me!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077125
    m_Localized: "Player: Thanks. How do I get to the school?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077126
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Take this map... It will always show you your destination!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077127
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Sorry, I don't have any more jobs right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077128
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: You've really got a lovely little car!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077129
    m_Localized: "Player: Thanks. I brought you the tires from the school bus."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077130
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Awesome! Just a little more and I'll be able to build my very own car! Then I'll get to see the Baker every day... Oops!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077131
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: If you happen to pass by, ask how the Baker is doing for me. Is everything all right with her?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077132
    m_Localized: "Player: Is she your friend?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077133
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: We barely know each other, to be honest... still, please ask..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077134
    m_Localized: "Player:  Может быть ей привезти что нибудь от тебя?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077135
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Exactly, let's do that, but what should I give her... hmm..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077136
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I've got it!!! Bring her this painting and ask if she'd mind meeting me by the Lake tomorrow..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077137
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Go on, quick! I can't wait to hear how it goes!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077138
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Well? Did you see the Baker? What did she say?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077139
    m_Localized: "Player: I told her exactly that. She thanked you for the painting and agreed to meet you by the Lake."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077140
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Really!? Wow... Did she actually agree?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077141
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. Looks like she really liked the painting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077142
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Well... there's no turning back now!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077143
    m_Localized: "Player: Looks like it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077144
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: You know... we already met up. And I think it went even better than I dreamed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077145
    m_Localized: "Player: Is that so? Congratulations."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077146
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Thanks. Who would've thought... I spent years trying to work up the courage, and in the end it was the new delivery driver who helped."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077147
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Now not only is my car almost assembled, but it feels like my whole life has finally started moving again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077148
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm happy for you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077149
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: I'm happy for myself too! All right, I won't keep you. I hope things work out for you and the Cat too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077150
    m_Localized: "Gas Station Attendant: Thank you. Without you, I never would've dared to talk to the Baker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077151
    m_Localized: "Cat: Meow!?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077152
    m_Localized: "Player: Who are you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077153
    m_Localized: "Cat: I... I don't know..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077154
    m_Localized: "Player: Easy, easy. Just tell me where your home is, and I'll take you there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077155
    m_Localized: "Cat: I don't know where my home is."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077156
    m_Localized: "Player: How long have you been here?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077157
    m_Localized: "Cat: It's cold and I'm hungry here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077158
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, get in the car and we'll figure out what to do with you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077159
    m_Localized: "Cat: I'm cold!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077160
    m_Localized: "Elk: Hello, mister... Who are you?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077161
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm a delivery driver. I was asked to bring two cartons of milk from the farm for the baker."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077162
    m_Localized: "Elk: Aaaah, I see. All right, I'll bring everything right away. You'll have to drive fast, though, because the weather's been really hot lately!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077163
    m_Localized: "Player: Thank you! You're so independent. But why are you here all alone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077164
    m_Localized: "Elk: Dad says the farm doesn't bring in much money, so he works at the school to earn extra. He says I need an education, so he wants to teach me himself..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077165
    m_Localized: "Player: I see. So your dad is the School Principal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077166
    m_Localized: "Elk: Yes, but honestly, I really don't want to go there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077167
    m_Localized: "Elk: I don't have any friends my age at all..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077168
    m_Localized: "Player: Don't be afraid. I hope the Cat will go to school with you. I'll make sure to introduce you two later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077169
    m_Localized: "Elk: All right! If you happen to see Dad, please ask him to come by. We've been having some power issues, and I got scared there might be a fire, so I didn't bring the milk."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077170
    m_Localized: "Elk: Just make sure to drive the milk over quickly, or it'll spoil."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077171
    m_Localized: "Elk: Oh, it's you again! Dad still hasn't stopped by..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077172
    m_Localized: "Player: I actually wanted to talk to you. I have an idea."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077173
    m_Localized: "Elk: What kind?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077174
    m_Localized: "Player: Remember the Cat I told you about? He's all alone too, and he's scared too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077175
    m_Localized: "Elk: Yeah... I feel bad for him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077176
    m_Localized: "Player: If you ask your dad yourself to let the Cat into the school, I think he'll listen to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077177
    m_Localized: "Elk: Really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077178
    m_Localized: "Player: Of course. You're his son, and you know better than anyone what it's like to be alone."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077179
    m_Localized: "Elk: I've never asked Dad for anything like that before..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077180
    m_Localized: "Player: Then this will be the first time. Sometimes you just have to say the important things out loud."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077181
    m_Localized: "Elk: Do you think he won't be angry?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077182
    m_Localized: "Player: I think he'll see how important this is to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077183
    m_Localized: "Elk: Then... I'll try. I'll tell him the Cat needs to study with me."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077184
    m_Localized: "Player: That's the spirit."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077185
    m_Localized: "Elk: Thank you, mister. It wouldn't be so scary with the Cat around."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077186
    m_Localized: "Elk: I'll talk to Dad. I'm just really nervous..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077187
    m_Localized: "Player: Hello, are you the Principal?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077188
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Yes, and you, my good fellow, must be our new driver? Thank you for the equipment!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077189
    m_Localized: "Teacher: If there's anything I can do for you, just say the word!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077190
    m_Localized: "Player: I found a kitten who doesn't know where his home is. Do you know where I could place him?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077191
    m_Localized: "Teacher: We have a boarding school for children. Unfortunately, tuition isn't free: the school has to pay for food, textbooks, and the teachers' work..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077192
    m_Localized: "Player: And how much does tuition cost?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077193
    m_Localized: "Teacher: 5000"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077194
    m_Localized: "Player: That much!? Where am I supposed to get that kind of money?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077195
    m_Localized: "Teacher: On this island, there are always people who need something delivered..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077196
    m_Localized: "Teacher: By the way, could you take these old books? They've been sitting uselessly in the library for years."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077197
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Could you deliver them to Grandma Owl? She absolutely loves detective stories."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077198
    m_Localized: "Teacher: Go on, I'll be waiting."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077199
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077200
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077201
    m_Localized: "Teacher: This is after my second quest."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077202
    m_Localized: "Player: Ok"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077203
    m_Localized: "Principal: Ah, it's you again. What do I owe the pleasure?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077204
    m_Localized: "Player: I wanted to talk about the Cat."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077205
    m_Localized: "Principal: About your little companion?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077206
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. I still want to enroll him in school, but I still haven't managed to gather the required amount."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077207
    m_Localized: "Principal: I understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077208
    m_Localized: "Player: But I was told that sometimes you do make exceptions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077209
    m_Localized: "Principal: Hm. Curious who told you that."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077210
    m_Localized: "Player: That's not the important part. What matters is that the Cat needs a home, and the Elk needs a friend."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077211
    m_Localized: "Principal: Is that so..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077212
    m_Localized: "Player: Your son really wants someone to study with. He wanted to ask you himself to take the Cat in."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077213
    m_Localized: "Principal: He wanted to ask me himself?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077214
    m_Localized: "Player: Yes. It matters to him."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077215
    m_Localized: "Principal: You know... perhaps I really do spend too much time thinking about bills, firewood, textbooks, and forget who all this is for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077216
    m_Localized: "Principal: If my son wants the Cat to study with him, then so be it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077217
    m_Localized: "Player: Really?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077218
    m_Localized: "Principal: Yes. I'm admitting the Cat to the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077219
    m_Localized: "Player: Thank you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077220
    m_Localized: "Principal: No need. Sometimes a school doesn't really need money - it just needs someone worth caring for."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077221
    m_Localized: "Principal: Congratulations. It looks like this will be your Cat's new home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518963077222
    m_Localized: "Principal: The Cat can stay. There will always be a place for him at the school."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465728
    m_Localized: "Player:  Вот Вы где!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465729
    m_Localized: "Owl: A sound mind in a sound body! At my age, that becomes obvious. And you, young man, must be that new delivery driver I've heard so much about. Very pleased!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465730
    m_Localized: "Player: Likewise. The Principal asked me to deliver a package. Here you go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465731
    m_Localized: "Owl: Why, thank you! How is my grandson doing? Working hard? Dressing warmly? (laughs)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465732
    m_Localized: "Owl: And when am I getting great-grandchildren? Oh, he'll leave his grandma without any! By any chance, do you know if he's found himself a bride yet? Maybe he likes someone?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465733
    m_Localized: "Player:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465734
    m_Localized: "Owl: Run along, dear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465735
    m_Localized: "Grandma: These buns smell wonderful! Thank you for getting here so quickly!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465736
    m_Localized: "Player: Always happy to help!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465737
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I heard you stopped by the farm. How is the little Elk doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465738
    m_Localized: "Player: He's managing. But he said he's scared to go to school without friends."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465739
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Hmmm... What about your Cat? Isn't he going to school too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465740
    m_Localized: "Player: I'd gladly send him there, but I don't have that much money.."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465741
    m_Localized: "Grandma: I see... Back in my day, education was free! It's all gone..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465742
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Actually, the Principal isn't nearly as strict as he likes to seem. If his son asks him to take in the Cat, I'm sure he will!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465743
    m_Localized: "Grandma: Oh, I almost forgot, I promised to send the Elk some ice for the cellar. Just hurry before it all melts!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465744
    m_Localized: "Grandma: If you hurry, the ice might still make it there in one piece."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465745
    m_Localized: "Player: I'm out of gas, I should go talk to the Gas Station Attendant..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465746
    m_Localized: "Baker: Oh, you're here so early, I'm afraid I don't have anything to offer you yet! Unless you'd like some cocoa?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465747
    m_Localized: "Player: No, thank you. Grandma asked me to bring her six buns..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465748
    m_Localized: "Baker: What bad timing! We've just run out of milk. This morning it all went into the cherry pie... I can't bake your buns without it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465749
    m_Localized: "Player: I can bring some. Just tell me where I need to go."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465750
    m_Localized: "Baker: Usually the Elk brings it from his farm, but he didn't show up today for some reason. Ask him to find us two cartons of milk. Just be careful, he's a little scared of strangers."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465751
    m_Localized: "Baker: Without milk, I can't bake buns no matter how hard I try."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465752
    m_Localized: "Baker: You brought it? Oh, thank you so much! I'll put the buns in the oven right away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465753
    m_Localized: "Baker: But it'll take a little time. Could you take this cherry pie to the school in the meantime? You have to drive quickly, though, or it'll cool off and won't be nearly as magical!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465754
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, should I pass anything else along?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465755
    m_Localized: "Baker: Yes, it's the Principal's birthday today, so don't forget to congratulate him! Maybe he'll be just a little kinder..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465756
    m_Localized: "Baker: Hurry, the pie is only good while it's warm!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465757
    m_Localized: "Player: I have a gift for you from the Gas Station Attendant - this beautiful painting! And an equally beautiful invitation to meet by the Lake tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465758
    m_Localized: "Baker: How lovely! Give him my heartfelt thanks and be sure to tell him I'll come tomorrow!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465759
    m_Localized: "Baker: I almost forgot - here are some cinnamon rolls for Grandma. Please take them to her quickly before they go bad!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465760
    m_Localized: "Player: All right, I'll be there in no time!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22148518971465761
    m_Localized: "Baker: Be sure to tell him I'll come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
